--   Director (Division 2): Andy Coradeschi -- appointed 2022-12-01 (month)
--   Director (Division 3): Gary Burns -- elected 2022-12-01 (month)
--   Director (Division 4): Leonard E. Polan -- appointed 2024-12-01 (month)
--   Director (Division 5): Jay Lewitt -- appointed 2022-12-01 (month)
-- Walnut Valley Water District (by division, 5 seats; RR/CC DST CAW WV; https://walnutvalleywater.gov/about-us/board-of-directors/):
--   Director (Division 1): Jerry Tang -- appointed 2024-12-01 (month)
--   Director (Division 2): Edwin M. Hilden -- elected 2022-12-01 (month)
--   Director (Division 3): Theresa Lee -- appointed 2022-12-01 (month)
--   Director (Division 4): Henry Woo -- appointed 2024-12-01 (month)
